{"seq":3,"slug":"question-answering","title":"问答系统与对话检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/ir-applications/question-answering","wordCount":1230,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"问答系统与对话检索\">问答系统与对话检索</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>问答系统（Question Answering，QA）是信息检索的高级形态——它不再返回文档列表让用户自行寻找答案，而是直接从文档中提取或生成精确的答案。从 IR 到 QA 的演进代表了信息访问范式的根本转变：从「给你相关文档」到「给你答案」。现代问答系统结合了信息检索、自然语言理解和自然语言生成三大技术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 问答系统架构&#10;        Q[用户问题] --&gt; QA[问题分析]&#10;        QA --&gt; QC[问题分类]&#10;        QA --&gt; QR[查询重构]&#10;        QR --&gt; R[文档检索]&#10;        R --&gt; P[段落检索]&#10;        P --&gt; AR[答案抽取/生成]&#10;        AR --&gt; A[最终答案]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 问答系统架构\n        Q[用户问题] --&gt; QA[问题分析]\n        QA --&gt; QC[问题分类]\n        QA --&gt; QR[查询重构]\n        QR --&gt; R[文档检索]\n        R --&gt; P[段落检索]\n        P --&gt; AR[答案抽取/生成]\n        AR --&gt; A[最终答案]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>QA 类型</th>\n<th>答案形式</th>\n<th>技术路线</th>\n<th>代表系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抽取式</td>\n<td>文档中的文本片段</td>\n<td>MRC 模型</td>\n<td>SQuAD 系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成式</td>\n<td>自由文本</td>\n<td>Seq2Seq / LLM</td>\n<td>ChatGPT, GPT-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识库式</td>\n<td>结构化答案</td>\n<td>KBQA</td>\n<td>IBM Watson</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表格式</td>\n<td>表格中的值</td>\n<td>Table QA</td>\n<td>TAPAS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"抽取式问答\">抽取式问答</h2><p>抽取式问答（Extractive QA）从给定的文档段落中精确定位答案的起始和结束位置。这个任务被形式化为机器阅读理解（Machine Reading Comprehension，MRC）——给定一个问题和一段上下文，模型需要预测答案在上下文中的起始和结束 token 位置。</p>\n<p>SQuAD（Stanford Question Answering Dataset）是推动抽取式 QA 发展的里程碑数据集。SQuAD 1.1 中每个问题都有答案（从对应段落中提取），SQuAD 2.0 增加了无答案问题，要求模型能判断「段落中没有答案」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ExtractiveQA {&#10;  answer(question: string, context: string): Promise&lt;ExtractedAnswer&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ExtractedAnswer {&#10;  readonly text: string;&#10;  readonly startIndex: number;&#10;  readonly endIndex: number;&#10;  readonly confidence: number;&#10;  readonly isNoAnswer: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface QAPipeline {&#10;  readonly retriever: DocumentRetriever;&#10;  readonly reader: ExtractiveQA;&#10;  answer(question: string): Promise&lt;PipelineAnswer&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PipelineAnswer {&#10;  readonly answer: string;&#10;  readonly confidence: number;&#10;  readonly sourceDocument: string;&#10;  readonly sourcePassage: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createQAPipeline = (retriever: DocumentRetriever, reader: ExtractiveQA, topK: number = 5): QAPipeline =&gt; ({&#10;  retriever,&#10;  reader,&#10;  answer: async (question) =&gt; {&#10;    const docs = await retriever.retrieve(question, topK);&#10;    const candidates: Array&lt;{&#10;      answer: ExtractedAnswer;&#10;      docId: string;&#10;      passage: string;&#10;    }&gt; = [];&#10;    for (const doc of docs) {&#10;      const passages = splitIntoPassages(doc.content, 512);&#10;      for (const passage of passages) {&#10;        const answer = await reader.answer(question, passage);&#10;        if (!answer.isNoAnswer) {&#10;          candidates.push({ answer, docId: doc.id, passage });&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    candidates.sort((a, b) =&gt; b.answer.confidence - a.answer.confidence);&#10;    const best = candidates[0];&#10;    return best&#10;      ? {&#10;          answer: best.answer.text,&#10;          confidence: best.answer.confidence,&#10;          sourceDocument: best.docId,&#10;          sourcePassage: best.passage,&#10;        }&#10;      : { answer: &#39;&#39;, confidence: 0, sourceDocument: &#39;&#39;, sourcePassage: &#39;&#39; };&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExtractiveQA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  answer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">question</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ExtractedAnswer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExtractedAnswer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> startIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shi