span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      confidence: verification.faithfulness,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"对话式检索\">对话式检索</h2><p>对话式检索（Conversational Search）将多轮对话的上下文引入检索过程。与单轮搜索不同，对话式检索需要处理指代消解（&quot;它的性能怎么样&quot; → 明确 &quot;它&quot; 指代什么）、话题延续（用户追问的细节应基于之前的讨论）和话题切换（识别用户开始了新话题）。</p>\n<p>对话式查询重写是解决对话检索核心挑战的关键技术——将依赖上下文的对话查询重写为自包含的完整查询。例如对话历史 &quot;Q1: React 是什么, A1: React 是一个 UI 框架, Q2: 它的虚拟 DOM 是怎么工作的&quot;，重写器将 Q2 重写为 &quot;React 的虚拟 DOM 是怎么工作的&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ConversationalSearch {&#10;  search(turn: ConversationTurn): Promise&lt;ReadonlyArray&lt;SearchResult&gt;&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ConversationTurn {&#10;  readonly query: string;&#10;  readonly history: ReadonlyArray&lt;{&#10;    query: string;&#10;    response: string;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;  readonly conversationId: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface QueryRewriter {&#10;  rewrite(turn: ConversationTurn): Promise&lt;string&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createConversationalSearch = (rewriter: QueryRewriter, searchEngine: SearchEngine): ConversationalSearch =&gt; ({&#10;  search: async (turn) =&gt; {&#10;    const rewrittenQuery = await rewriter.rewrite(turn);&#10;    return searchEngine.search(rewrittenQuery, { topK: 10 });&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConversationalSearch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E