an></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> intermediateAnswer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> hopNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>问答系统将 IR 从「返回文档」提升到「返回答案」，代表信息访问范式的根本转变</li>\n<li>Retriever-Reader 架构是开放域抽取式 QA 的标准范式，DPR 显著提升了检索阶段的性能</li>\n<li>RAG 是当前最主流的生成式 QA 架构，答案验证机制是控制幻觉风险的关键</li>\n<li>对话式检索通过查询重写技术解决指代消解和上下文依赖问题</li>\n<li>多跳问答需要多轮迭代检索和推理组合，是 QA 系统中最具挑战性的形式</li>\n<li>QA 系统的评估需要同时考量答案准确性、完整性、可溯源性和响应延迟</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"问答系统与对话检索","id":"问答系统与对话检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"抽取式问答","id":"抽取式问答"},{"level":2,"text":"生成式问答与 RAG","id":"生成式问答与-rag"},{"level":2,"text":"对话式检索","id":"对话式检索"},{"level":2,"text":"多跳问答","id":"多跳问答"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文本分类与过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/ir-applications/text-classification"},"next":null}